File Index

/README.md
Purpose: What the extension does, how to run/develop/package it, and the manual-sync note for the color table.

/esbuild.mjs
Purpose: Bundles src/extension.ts to dist/extension.js (CJS, node20, vscode external); --production for minified/no-sourcemap, --watch for incremental rebuilds during F5 debugging.

/package.json
Purpose: VS Code extension manifest (dsl-color-preview) — command contribution, editor/title icon, explorer/editor context-menu entries scoped to .txt files, esbuild-backed build/watch/package/typecheck scripts.

/tsconfig.json
Purpose: NodeNext build config extending the repo base, typed against @types/vscode and @types/node.

/src/ansi.ts
Purpose: ANSI SGR -> HTML, stripAnsi and DSL -> ANSI; hand-synced copies (dsl-log-preview ansiToHtml, game-client dsl-to-ansi) since a VSIX cannot import across the workspace. Change together with those.

/src/convert.ts
Purpose: vscode-free dispatch (ansi vs dsl by detectFormat) behind the preview and both copy commands; keep it free of vscode imports so it can be bundled and checked standalone.
